odtrekking.it/percorsi/italia/trekking-lazio/una-montagna-spaccata-a-picco-sul-mare-il-percorso-di-trekking-perfetto-per-unesperienza-piacevole-nel-parco-del-monte-orlando/","https://scoprigaeta.it/en/attrazione/montagna-spaccata-mount-orlando/","https://www.komoot.com/guide/503509/fantastici-trekking-e-escursioni-nei-dintorni-del-parco-regionale-urbano-monte-orlando","https://leggeretiportainalto.it/escursioni-in-montagna/la-montagna-spaccata-e-la-grotta-del-turco-a-gaeta/","https://www.dinamikalibera.it/news/145-26-05-2024-hiking-sul-monte-orlando-la-montagna-spaccata-e-gaeta-medievale","https://www.trekkingedivertimento.it/gaeta-e-grotta-del-turco-ott25"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Swimming at Spiaggia di Serapo","type":"swim","detail":"Gaeta's long town beach, fine pale sand and a shallow bar that stays waist deep well out, with the headland closing one end.","season":[6,7,8,9],"evidence":{"n_sources":7,"of":23,"urls":["https://www.viator.com/Gaeta-attractions/Serapo-Beach-Spiaggia-di-Serapo/d27666-a101681","https://www.getyourguide.com/serapo-beach-gaeta-l186123/","https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attractions-g187790-Activities-Gaeta_Province_of_Latina_Lazio.html","https://www.juliettesforksandfootprints.com/blog-posts/things-to-do-in-gaeta-italy","https://wowiwalkers.com/things-to-do-in-gaeta/","https://wherelovisawanders.com/things-to-do-in-gaeta/","https://www.italygonia.com/2025/12/17/15-best-things-to-do-in-gaeta/"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Boat trip along the cliffs to the sea caves","type":"experience","detail":"Half day sailings past cliffs over 80 metres tall, stopping to swim and snorkel at coves and grottoes that no road reaches.","season":[5,6,7,8,9,10],"link":"https://www.getyourguide.com/gaeta-l176273/gaeta-sperlonga-boat-tour-swim-and-snorkeling-4-hours-t465864/","evidence":{"n_sources":6,"of":23,"urls":["https://www.getyourguide.com/gaeta-l176273/gaeta-sperlonga-boat-tour-swim-and-snorkeling-4-hours-t465864/","http